  "lyrics": [
    "I unfold you in the passenger seat light",
    "A paper ghost with tangled lines",
    "Tracing a path I thought I knew by heart",
    "But every crease just tears us more apart",
    "This highway's whispering a different name",
    "And your thin edges tremble in the frame",
    "(Ooh-oh)",
    "My roadmap love, you're slipping from my hands",
    "A thousand futures, a thousand different plans",
    "You fold a new way every time I try",
    "To find the route back to your heart and why",
    "We're lost inside these fading ink-drawn lands",
    "Remember holding you beneath the sun?",
    "Our destination seemed the only one",
    "I marked a star right where we were supposed to be",
    "But now the page is worn, I can't quite see",
    "That confident X I drew with so much hope",
    "Just another intersection I can't cope",
    "(Ooh-oh, my love)",
    "My roadmap love, you're slipping from my hands",
    "A thousand futures, a thousand different plans",
    "You fold a new way every time I try",
    "To find the route back to your heart and why",
    "We're lost inside these fading ink-drawn lands",
    "Maybe I should just let the corners tear",
    "And let the wind decide the when and where",
    "Stop trying to refold you back to the start",
    "(Back to the start)",
    "And learn to read the map of my own heart",
    "(Ohhh)",
    "My roadmap love, slipping from my hands!",
    "A thousand futures, a thousand different plans!",
    "You fold a new way every time I try!",
    "To find the way back, oh I have to try!",
    "We're lost inside these fading ink-drawn lands!"
  ],
